Now we substitute $\blueD{g(x)=\dfrac{\sqrt{3x^2}}{2}}$ and $\goldD{g'(x)=\dfrac{3x}{2\sqrt{3x^2}}}$ into the equation:

$\begin{align}
\goldD{g'(x)}&=\dfrac{3x}{4\blueD{g(x)}}
\\\\
\goldD{\dfrac{3x}{2\sqrt{3x^2}}}&\stackrel{?}{=}\dfrac{3x}{4\left(\blueD{\dfrac{\sqrt{3x^2}}{2}}\right)}
\\\\
\dfrac{3x}{2\sqrt{3x^2}}&\stackrel{\checkmark}{=}\dfrac{3x}{2\sqrt{3x^2}}
\end{align}$

We obtained the same expression on each side.
